    reserve_pergen: { cell: "K", ev: "pjm-120. SUB-PRODUCT LEG pjm_reserve_pergen_sync (the Manual 11 sec 4.2/4.3.3 SYNCHRONIZED split) SCREENED AND REFUTED 2026-09-13 by lane pjm-h3 on the owner-RE-OPENED price-formation frontier (docs/calibration-log/governance.md 2026-09-13 OWNER RULING; pre-registration docs/PRECOMMIT-pjm-h3-reserve-sync-2026-09-13.md pushed at ed6bb0996d2685884d1f05eb105c3bef4dea138c BEFORE any solve, gates fixed there and not re-read; result docs/RESULT-pjm-h3-reserve-sync-screen-2026-09-13.md). The family row stays K -- pjm_reserve_pergen itself is unchanged and armed in the keeper; it is the SYNC sub-leg that is refuted, recorded here per the pjm-151 census convention that a sub-product leg lives on its family row. KILLED AT THE PRE-REGISTERED S2 LIVENESS GATE: the SYNC dual is non-zero in 107 of 8760 hours = 1.22 % against a >= 20 % bar and against PJM published 61.3 % in 2022 (pjm_sync 0 hours, pjm_sync_mad 107). THE MECHANISM IS STRUCTURALLY CORRECT AND QUANTITATIVELY INERT, and both halves are measured: it ARMS reliably (4 balance families pjm_primary/pjm_primary_mad/pjm_sync/pjm_sync_mad vs the control 2, 78 R columns, req means [2663, 2662, 1902, 1901] MW, identical across three independent container attempts); S3 SHAPE PASSES perfectly (h16-18 mean $0.1333 vs h01-04 mean $0.0000, ratio +inf -- the credit is strictly peak-confined, zero overnight, which is exactly what pjm-138 sec 7 lead 1 demands of a successor); S4 CONFINEMENT PASSES (Pearson r(delta energy dual, SYNC dual) = +0.738 vs a +0.30 bar; mean |delta| in SYNC-zero hours is 0.17 % of that in SYNC-positive hours vs a 25 % bar); and S5 PASSES with no protected criterion (C2/C4/C8) moving. It also moves the reserve rent to the CORRECT product -- the control priced 2 hours in pjm_primary_mad (a synchronized requirement met by offline capacity, the pjm-87 misrepresentation) and the arm prices 0 there and 107 in pjm_sync_mad at up to $65.27, mean $6.23, median $1.85, ZERO shortfall hours (binding-at-requirement rent, never an ORDC shortfall). BUT IT MOVES NOTHING: largest class delta CC_REGULAR -0.0100 TWh on 319.69; C1 CC_REGULAR +22.56 -> +22.55 TWh; C3a -10.7 % -> -10.7 %; C3b 0.246 -> 0.246; C3c 3h -> 3h; annual load-weighted price 64.074 -> 64.092 $/MWh. CAUSE, measured at zero LP in the parent and corroborated by the solve itself: PJM fleet 10-min ramp is 38.24 GW availability-weighted (the solve log independently reports 38.2 GW) against a measured SYNC requirement of 1.71 GW = 22.3x margin -- WIDER than the ~19x FINDING-pjm-eas-screen-2026-09-07 measured on the Primary requirement, because the SYNC requirement is the smaller of the two. Online-only scoping moves CT_PEAKER (14.75 GW of ramp, mostly offline) to the NON-SYNC column but leaves CC_REGULAR (15.76 GW) as the SYNC source, still ~9x the requirement, so the published ORDC knee fires only in 107 summer midday hours (Jun 43 / Jul 21 / Aug 28 / Sep 15, hod 11-16). CONSEQUENCE BEYOND THIS CELL: the tightest defensible reserve product definition the design space offers -- online-only, 10-min deliverable ramp, sharing the pool joint P+R headroom row -- STILL cannot make PJM reserve scarcity bind at this fleet size. That EXTENDS the pjm-eas retirement of the family of PJM levers routed through reserve scarcity from the forecast lane to the BACKCAST lane. DO-NOT-REDO: do not propose a further reserve-product refinement for PJM price formation -- the supply margin, not the product definition, is the binding object. OPERATIONAL COST, reported because it is real: the arm doubles the R-column count and OOM-killed P0 on three successive standard containers (anon-RSS 13.28 GiB against a 13.34 GiB cgroup ceiling; memory.memsw.max_usage 17.33 GiB = ceiling + 4 GiB swap exactly, i.e. 100 % of RAM AND 100 % of swap consumed); it completed only after hydrate_data.py --profile pjm --force freed 4.1 GiB of disk so the preflight could reach ~23 GiB of ceiling+swap. NOTHING ARMS: pjm_reserve_pergen_sync stays default-off, the PJM keeper 2026-09-11-pjm-d4-4-gasoutage is re-scored BEFORE and AFTER as CALIBRATED 8/8 with zero caveats and is UNCHANGED, and rule 29 clause 2 means the 2020/2021 years were never spent. Screen bundle retrievable at shard sha 786affd47cf95334aa1fc7579135c230492f1296." },
