    soco_gas_st_campaign_commitment: { cell: ".", ev: "ROW SEEDED 2026-09-19 (soco-53d) WITH THE FIELD, per rule 28(c) — n/a: the mechanism's object is SOCO's own ISO-exclusive field and per-plant measured artifact, and no non-owner ISO has entered this cell at HEAD, so there is no PJM object to arm. The gate is default off and this ISO's keeper is byte-identical. Not a verdict; a later lane that identifies a PJM analogue re-opens it as U, and derives its own parameters from its own market's CAMPD record (rules 25 [R-ISO-SCOPE] / 28(d)) — SOCO's numbers transfer to no one." },
