    coal_mustrun_requires_measured_row: { cell: "K", ev: "pjm-h14 (2026-09-20) — PROMOTED to the PJM keeper 2026-09-20-pjm-h14-coalmustrun-span. Six shards, one year each, pinned SHA 3b44a752, composed at zero LP. G1/G2/G4 PASS (G2 exactly: ZERO uncovered plants floored on the arm in any year); G3 and G5 FAIL and are disclosed rather than argued away — G3's five residual D-4 coal conduct failures are ALL on COVERED plants the arm does not touch (a gate-scoping error by the lane, not amended), G5's 2020 breach is ~70% a denominator move. Determination HELD with ZERO criterion flips: span CALIBRATED 8/8 PASS zero caveats, touchpoint NOT-YET, both re-scored at HEAD against the incumbent. ZERO free parameters." },
