    gas_flow_date_year_start_package: { cell: "U", ev: "xiso-8 introduced this SHARED field (2026-09-20). Rule 25 [R-ISO-SCOPE] forbids carrying a verdict across ISOs, so this cell enters UNTESTED and this ISO's lane derives its own evidence. Byte-identical here today: the field is default-off, and this ISO reaches _flow_date_staircase only if it arms one of the citygate/Chicago daily paths that pass prior_year_dated. The measurement a lane needs is one zero-LP run of scripts/probes/xiso8_left_edge_census.py pointed at its own dated map -- the question is (a) which of its year boundaries are TRADING PACKAGES rather than EIA publication blackouts, and (b) whether its live call site is a LEVEL channel or a mean-preserving within-month SHAPE channel. CAISO's four scored years are all packages on a level channel; MISO's are mostly blackouts on a shape channel, and its exposure came out ~30x smaller. PRECOMMIT-xiso8-year-start-left-edge-2026-09-20.md." },
